{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721807001:1":{"text":"중앙 광장에서 큰일이 났다면서요?","source_cn":"中央广场出大事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A11BB628F34EA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721807002:1":{"text":"고대의 전당과 관련된 일이라던데.","source_cn":"听说跟圣古堂有关","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC8850CDB57631D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721807003:1":{"text":"근위대가 많이 출동했대요...","source_cn":"去了好多守备军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55B9FE55E11F6EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721807004:1":{"text":"가지 않는 게 좋겠네요.","source_cn":"那我还是不去凑热闹了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DB87C66BEAE0C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721807005:1":{"text":"고대의 전당이... 돌아왔다고? 갑자기?!","source_cn":"圣古堂……回来了？在这种时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79EC2C6214E20EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721807006:1":{"text":"그럼 페기와 카세디아가...","source_cn":"如果是这样，那佩吉和科丝蒂